{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 390,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Some things are not normal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3060,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By that I mean if you go out in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5100,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and start measuring things\nlike human height, IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8250,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the size of apples on a tree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10410,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You will find that for\neach of these things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12810,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most of the data clusters\naround some average value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16410,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is so common that we call\nit the normal distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20730,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but some things in life are not like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24180,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Nature shows power\nlaws all over the place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27060,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That seems weird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28050,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, is nature tuning\nitself to criticality?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30750,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you make a crude measure\nof how big is the world war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33240,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by how many people it kills,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34890,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that it follows a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37110,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The outcome will vary in size\nover 10 million, 100 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42270,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's much more likelihood\nof really big events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45210,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than you would expect from\na normal distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47370,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they will totally skew the average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49680,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The system you're\nlooking at doesn't have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52080,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any inherent physical scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54390,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really hard to know\nwhat's gonna happen next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56250,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The more you measure,\nthe bigger the average is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59580,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really weird,\nit sounds impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61650,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's very important to try to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64530,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which game you're playing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66090,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what are the payoffs\ngoing to be in the long run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70590,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In the late 1800s, Italian\nengineer Vilfredo Pareto"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73890,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stumbled upon something\nno one had seen before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77130,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, he suspected there\nmight be a hidden pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79860,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in how much money people make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81840,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he gathered income tax records"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83520,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from Italy, England, France,\nand other European countries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86820,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for each country he plotted\nthe distribution of income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91110,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each country he looked at,\nhe saw the same pattern,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94200,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a pattern which still holds\nin most countries to this day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98490,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's not a normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101370,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you think about a normal\ndistribution like height,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103830,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a clearly defined average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105840,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and extreme outliers\nbasically never happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108900,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you are never\ngoing to find someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110640,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who is, say, five times\nthe average height,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113370,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be physically impossible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115260,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Pareto's income\ndistributions were different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117990,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take this curve for England,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119520,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it shows the number of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120900,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who earn more than a certain income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123120,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The curve starts off declining steeply,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125340,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most people earn relatively little,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127530,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then it falls away gradually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129690,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much more slowly than a\nnormal distribution would,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132600,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it spans several orders of magnitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135810,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were people who\nearned 5 times, 10 times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138270,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even 100 times more than others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141150,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of spread just wouldn't happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142830,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if income were normally distributed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145800,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now to shrink this huge spread of data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148170,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pareto calculated the\nlogarithms of all the values"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150990,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and plotted those instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152760,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words, he used a log-log plot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155340,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when he did that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156360,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the broad curve transformed\ninto a straight line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159870,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gradient was around negative 1.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162810,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means each time\nyou double the income,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165270,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say, from 200 pounds to 400 pounds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167730,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the number of people\nearning at least that amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170160,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drops off by a factor of\ntwo to the power of 1.5,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173580,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is around 2.8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175290,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this pattern holds for\nevery doubling of income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178560,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Pareto could describe\nthe distribution of incomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181020,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with one simple equation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182940,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The number of people who\nearn an income greater than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185460,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or equal to X is\nproportional to one over X"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188520,
    "dDurationMs": 1053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the power of 1.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190830,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, that's what Pareto saw for England,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193020,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he performed the same\nanalysis on data from Italy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196230,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "France, Prussia, and a\nbunch of other countries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198960,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he saw the same thing again and again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202410,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each time the data transformed\ninto a straight line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206010,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the gradients were remarkably similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208650,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That meant Pareto could\ndescribe the income distribution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211500,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in each country with the same equation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214440,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one over the income to some power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217140,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where that power is just\nthe absolute gradient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219930,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the logarithmic graph."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222060,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This type of relationship\nis called a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225690,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you move from the world\nof normal distributions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228120,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the world of power laws,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229620,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things change dramatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231570,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to illustrate this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232620,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's take a trip to the casino"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234270,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to play three different games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237180,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At table number one, you\nget 100 tosses of a coin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241200,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each time you flip and it\nlands on heads, you win $1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245460,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the question is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246540,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much would you be prepared\nto pay to play this game?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249960,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we need to work out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251010,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much you'd expect to win in this game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252960,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then pay less than\nthat expected value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255600,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the probability of\nthrowing a head is 1/2."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258780,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Multiply that by $1 and\nmultiply that by 100 tosses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262350,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gives you an expected payout of $50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265050,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you should be willing to pay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266520,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything less than $50 to play this game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269160,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, you might not win every time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you play the\ngame hundreds of times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273750,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the small variations\neither side of the average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275700,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will cancel out and you can\nexpect to turn a profit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279090,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the first people to\nstudy this kind of problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281160,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was Abraham de Moivre in the early 1700s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284190,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He showed that if you plot the\nprobability of each outcome,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286770,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get a bell-shaped curve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288480,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was later coined\nthe normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291690,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Normal distributions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292830,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the traditional explanation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294180,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that when there are a lot\nof effects that are random"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296970,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are adding up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298050,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's when you expect normals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300090,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like how tall I am depends\non a lot of random things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303510,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about my nutrition, about\nmy parents' genetics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306300,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all kinds of things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307170,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if these random effects are additive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310650,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is what tends to lead to normals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314400,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- At table number two, there's\na slightly different game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317520,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You still get 100 tosses of the coin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320220,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321053,
    "dDurationMs": 2797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of potentially\nwinning a dollar on each flip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323850,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your winnings are\nmultiplied by some factor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326850,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you start out with $1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329160,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then every time you toss a head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331230,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you multiply your winnings by 1.1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334080,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If instead the coin lands on tails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336240,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you multiply your winnings by 0.9."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338730,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after 100 tosses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340170,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you take home the total,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341760,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is the dollar you started with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343500,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times the string of 1.1s and 0.9s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346770,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, how much should you\npay to play this game?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349830,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, on each flip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351120,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your payout can either grow or shrink,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353730,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and each is equally likely\neach time you toss the coin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357120,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the expected factor each turn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359130,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just 1.1 plus 0.9 divided\nby two, which is one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362850,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you start out with $1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365130,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then your expected payout is just $1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368190,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means you should be willing to pay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369780,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything less than a dollar\nto play this game, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373170,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if you look at the\ndistribution of payouts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375630,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see that you could win big."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377730,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you tossed 100 heads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379440,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'd win 1.1 to the power of 100."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381810,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's almost $14,000,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384480,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "although the chance of that happening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385860,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is around 1 in 10 to the power of 30."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387990,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd be more likely to win the lottery"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389550,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "three times in a row."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390870,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, the median\npayout is around 61 cents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394410,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're only\nplaying the game one time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396810,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you want even odds\nof turning a profit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399660,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, then you should\npay less than 61 cents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402660,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Though either way, if you played\nthe game hundreds of times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405270,
    "dDurationMs": 2113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your payout would average out to $1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408330,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, watch what happens\nif we switch the x-axis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410460,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a linear scale to\na logarithmic scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413010,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, then you see the curve transforms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414960,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416730,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why this type of distribution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418530,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is called a log normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421050,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When random effects multiply,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I have a certain wealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425340,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then my wealth goes up by\na certain percentage next year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428400,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because of my investments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430140,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the year after that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431190,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it changes by another random factor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434220,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as opposed to adding, I'm\nmultiplying year after year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437430,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have a big product\nof random numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439980,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you take the log of a product,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441630,
    "dDurationMs": 1623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's the sum of the logs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444180,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was a product of random numbers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446520,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then gets translated into sums\nof logs of random numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451170,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what leads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452003,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this so-called log normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454380,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And log normal distributions\nproduce big inequalities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458340,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't just see a mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460560,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you see a mean with a big long tail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462810,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's much more likelihood\nof really big events,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465780,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this case, tremendous\nwealth being obtained,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468750,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than you would expect from\na normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The reason this curve is so asymmetric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473790,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is because the downside is capped at zero,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476280,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so at most, you could lose $1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478770,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the upside can keep\ngrowing up to nearly $14,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483750,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's go on to table three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485730,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, you'll be tossing a coin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487410,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this time you start out with a dollar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489570,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the payout doubles\neach time you toss the coin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492660,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you keep tossing\nuntil you get a heads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495660,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the game ends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497190,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you get heads on your\nfirst toss, you get $2."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500610,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you get a tails first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502050,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then hit a heads on your\nsecond toss, you get $4."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505200,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you flipped two tails and then a head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507120,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on your third toss,\nyou'd get $8, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510270,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it took you to the\nnth toss to get a heads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512700,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would get two to the n dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515430,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, how much should you\npay to play this game?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518970,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, as in our previous example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520530,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we need to work out the expected value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522750,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So suppose you throw a\nhead on your first try,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525390,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the payout is $2"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526710,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the probability of\nthat outcome is a half,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529380,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the expected value of\nthat toss is a dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532770,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it takes you two tosses to get a heads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534990,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the payout is $4"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536580,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the probability of that\nhappening is one over four,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539430,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so again, the expected value is $1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542280,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also need to add in the chance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543870,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you flip heads on your third try,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545550,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that case, the payout is $8"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547620,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the probability of that\nhappening is one over eight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550350,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so again, the expected value is $1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553530,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we have to keep\nrepeating this calculation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over all possible outcomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557880,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have to keep adding $1 for\neach of the different options"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560700,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for flipping the coin, say, 10\ntimes until it lands on heads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563550,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or 100 times before you get heads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566010,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know it's extremely unlikely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568050,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the payout is so huge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569640,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the expected value of\nthat outcome is still a dollar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573300,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it still increases the\nexpected value of the whole game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577140,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means that, theoretically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579150,
    "dDurationMs": 3903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the total expected value\nof this game is infinite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584070,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as the\nSt. Petersburg paradox."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587220,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at the\ndistribution of payouts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589440,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see it's uncapped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591330,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it spans across all orders of magnitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593850,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could get a payout\nof $1,000, $100,000,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596970,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even a million dollars or more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599190,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while a million\ndollar payout is unlikely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601890,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not that unlikely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603480,
    "dDurationMs": 1683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's around one in a million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606000,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you transform\nboth axes to a log scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608940,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you see a straight line with\na gradient of negative one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612420,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The payout of the St. Petersburg paradox"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614580,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "follows a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616260,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The specific power law in this case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618090,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the probability of a payout x"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620190,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is equal to x to the power of\nnegative one or one over x."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624330,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the previous games when\nyou have a normal distribution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626760,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even a log normal distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628740,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can measure the width\nof that distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631140,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its standard deviation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632970,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in a normal distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634380,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "95% of the data fall within\ntwo standard deviations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637590,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the mean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638670,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with a power law, like in\nthe St. Petersburg paradox,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641820,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is no measurable width,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643950,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the standard deviation is infinite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646890,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This makes power laws a\nfundamentally different beast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with some very weird properties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652770,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Imagine you take a\nbunch of random samples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654810,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then average them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655980,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then take more random\nsamples and average them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658590,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll find that the\naverage keeps going up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661470,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't converge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663240,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the more you measure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664320,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bigger the average is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666900,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really weird,\nit sounds impossible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669390,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's because it has such a heavy tail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672150,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning the probability of\nreally whopping big events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675480,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is so significant that\nif you keep measuring,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678360,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "occasionally you're gonna measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of those extreme outliers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681420,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they will totally skew the average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684780,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's sort of like saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686460,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you're standing in a room\nwith Bill Gates or Elon Musk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690240,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the average wealth in that room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692820,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is gonna be 100 billion\ndollars or something (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696960,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the average is\ndominated by one outlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699990,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And that same idea, one\noutlier can dominate the average,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703140,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shows up online too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705030,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A handful of companies, servers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707070,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and data centers hold\nthe personal information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709470,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of millions of people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710790,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when one of them gets hacked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712110,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can have ripple effects\nacross the whole network."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716370,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've had scammers get a\nhold of email addresses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718950,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and phone numbers of writers on our team"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721140,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then send them messages\npretending to be me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724140,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is where today's\nsponsor, NordVPN, comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727170,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NordVPN encrypts your internet traffic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729270,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so your personal data stays private,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731190,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even when the wider system isn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733290,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It protects you from hackers, trackers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735120,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and malware with threat protection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736920,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even when you're not connected to a VPN."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739380,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within just 15 minutes of\nregistering a new email,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742740,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we saw that five leaks\nhad already been detected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745500,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NordVPN lets you browse securely\nfrom anywhere in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748560,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by routing your connection\nthrough encrypted servers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750990,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in over 60 countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can try it completely risk-free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a 30-day money-back guarantee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756600,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just scan this QR code or\ngo to NordVPN.com/veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761070,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get a huge discount on a two-year plan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763440,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plus four extra months free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765360,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's NordVPN.com/veritasium\nfor a huge discount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768990,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll put the link down in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770910,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd like to thank NordVPN\nfor sponsoring this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773550,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, back to power laws."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776400,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, why do you get a power law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778440,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the simple St. Petersburg setup?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781890,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at the payout x,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783870,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see it grows exponentially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785790,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with each toss of the coin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787590,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "x equals two to the n."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789540,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at the\nprobability of tossing the coin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792330,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that many times to get a heads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794160,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see that this probability\nshrinks exponentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797670,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the probability of\nflipping a coin n times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800100,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is 1/2 to the power of n."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802260,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're not really interested\nin the number of tosses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804720,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're interested in the payout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806400,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we know that x equals two to the n,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808530,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so instead of writing two to the n"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809970,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in our probability equation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811230,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can just write x."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812940,
    "dDurationMs": 1677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we end up with this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814617,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the probability of a payout of x dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816870,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is equal to one over x,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818700,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or in other words, x to\nthe power of negative one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822390,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You put them together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824250,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the exponentials conspire\nto make a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827310,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's a very common thing in nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829440,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a lot of times\nwhen we see power laws,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831330,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are two underlying exponentials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833700,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are dancing together\nto make a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837540,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One example of this is earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839790,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at data on earthquakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841260,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that small\nearthquakes are very common,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843990,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but earthquakes of increasing magnitudes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846330,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "become exponentially rarer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849090,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the destruction that earthquakes cause"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850860,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not proportional to their magnitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852870,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's proportional to\nthe energy they release."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855270,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as earthquakes grow in magnitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857490,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that energy grows exponentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860010,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So there's this exponential decay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in frequency of earthquakes\nof a given magnitude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864900,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an exponential increase in\nthe amount of energy released"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869610,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by earthquakes of a certain magnitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871770,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you combine those two exponentials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874620,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to eliminate the magnitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876060,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you find is a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878670,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But power laws also\nreveal something deeper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880860,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the underlying\nstructure of a system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883230,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To see this in action,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884370,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's go back to the third coin game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886040,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the St. Petersburg paradox."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888510,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you can draw all\nthe different outcomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890430,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a tree diagram"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891630,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the length of each branch\nis equal to its probability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894780,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So starting with a\nsingle line of length one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896850,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then 1/2 for the first two branches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899040,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1/4 for the next four, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901440,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when you zoom in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903120,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you keep seeing the\nsame structure repeating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905490,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at smaller and smaller scales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907440,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's self-similar like a fractal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910020,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's no coincidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912000,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We see the same fractal-like\npattern in the veins on a leaf,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915120,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "river networks, the blood\nvessels in our lungs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918150,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even lightning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919350,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in all of these cases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920790,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can describe the\npattern with a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923940,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Power laws and fractals\nare intrinsically linked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926970,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because power laws\nreveal something fundamental"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929820,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about a system's structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931740,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I've got a magnet\nand I've got a screw,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934140,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll notice if I\nbring them close together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936570,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the screw gets\nattracted to the magnet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939270,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because\nthere's a lot of iron it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940740,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is ferromagnetic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942510,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But watch what happens if\nI start heating this up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946260,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trying to..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947093,
    "dDurationMs": 1297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948390,
    "dDurationMs": 912,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949302,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, there it went!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950135,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There it went!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950968,
    "dDurationMs": 3512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, you heat it up and\nsuddenly it becomes nonmagnetic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954480,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To find out what happened,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955740,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's zoom in on this magnet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958050,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Inside a magnet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959010,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each atom has its own magnetic moment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961230,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means you can think of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962310,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like its own little magnet or compass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964650,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If one atom's moment points up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966630,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its neighbors tend to point that way too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968670,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since this lowers the system's\noverall potential energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971580,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore at low temperatures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972960,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get large regions called domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975000,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where all the moments align."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977370,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when many of these domains also align,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979560,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their individual magnetic fields reinforce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981870,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create an overall\nfield around the magnet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984930,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you heat up the magnet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986550,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each atom starts vibrating vigorously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989010,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moments flip up and down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so the alignment can break down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993750,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when all the moments cancel out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995460,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then there's no longer\na net magnetic field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998760,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you have the right equipment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000230,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can balance any magnetic material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002420,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right on that transition point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004280,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right between magnetic and nonmagnetic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007040,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is called the critical point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008930,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it occurs at a specific temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011150,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called the Curie temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013160,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I asked Casper and the\nteam to build a simulation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015770,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to show what's going on inside the magnet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018350,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at this critical point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020480,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Each pixel represents\nthe magnetic moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022700,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of an individual atom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024020,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say red is up and blue is down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027020,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when the temperature is low,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028670,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we get these big domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030230,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the magnetic moments are all aligned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032660,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you get an overall magnetic field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035150,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we really crank up the temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037760,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then all of these moments\nstart flipping up and down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040130,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they cancel out and the\nmagnet loses its magnetism,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043850,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that's exactly what\nhappened in our demo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046700,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we tune the temperature just right,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049280,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right to that Curie temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051380,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the pattern becomes\nway more interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054650,
    "dDurationMs": 1323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This looks like a map."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056900,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Like a map?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058010,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, it almost looks like\nthe Mediterranean or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060950,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's almost stable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063350,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like atoms that are pointing one way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tend to point that way for a while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069500,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there is clearly fluctuations as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073520,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so domains are constantly\ncoming and going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076610,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's both got some elements of stability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080000,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and some persistence over time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082070,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some features which are consistent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084410,
    "dDurationMs": 3609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's also not locked in place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088019,
    "dDurationMs": 4071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you notice changes over time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092090,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] If you zoom in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092960,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that the same kinds of patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094820,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "repeat at all scales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096140,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got domains of tens of atoms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097850,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hundreds, thousands, even millions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100220,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just no inherent\nscale to the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102530,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is, it's scale-free,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104450,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just like a fractal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106100,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you plot the size\ndistribution of the domains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108770,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111950,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The underlying geometry\nsuddenly shows a fractal character"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114950,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it doesn't have on either\nside of the phase transition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118130,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right at the phase transition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119570,
    "dDurationMs": 1647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get fractal behavior"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121217,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that pops out as a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123440,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In fact, whenever you find a power law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125600,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that indicates you're\ndealing with a system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127550,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that has no intrinsic scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129950,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is a signature of a\nsystem in a critical state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133430,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which turns out has huge consequences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136940,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- See, normally in a magnet\nbelow the Curie temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139460,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each atom influences only its neighbors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141890,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If one atom's magnetic moment flips up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144050,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then that means that its\nneighbors are slightly more likely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146390,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to point up too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147740,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that influence is local,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149120,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it dies out just a few atoms away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151040,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as the magnet approaches\nits critical temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153560,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those local influences\nstart to chain together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156170,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One spin nudges its neighbor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157790,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that neighbor nudges\nthe next and so on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a rumor spreading through a crowd."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162860,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the result is that the\neffective range of influence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165380,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keeps expanding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166490,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and right at the critical point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168230,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it becomes effectively infinite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170540,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A flip on one side can cascade"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172700,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughout the entire material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175280,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you get these small\ncauses, just a single flip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178700,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reverberate throughout\nthe entire system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181370,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And it gets right into that point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184370,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the system is maximally unstable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187820,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything can happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188990,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also maximally interesting in a way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191810,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means the system is most unpredictable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195200,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most uncertain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196520,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's really hard to know\nwhat's gonna happen next,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198500,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that seems to be a natural procedure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200720,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that happens in many different\nsystems in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203270,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One such system is forest fires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206780,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In June, 1988,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208370,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lightning strike started a small fire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "near Yellowstone National Park."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212540,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was nothing out of the ordinary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each year, Yellowstone\nexperiences thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216590,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of lightning strikes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217730,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most don't cause fires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219200,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those that do tend\nto burn a few trees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221300,
    "dDurationMs": 3185,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe even a few acres\nbefore they fizzle out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224485,
    "dDurationMs": 3745,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3/4 of fires burn less\nthan 1/4 of an acre."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228230,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The largest fire in the\npark's recent history"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230300,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "occurred in 1931."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232190,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That burned through 18,000 acres,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234440,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an area slightly larger than Manhattan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237020,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the 1988 fire was different,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239570,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that initial spark spread slowly at first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242450,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "covering several thousand acres."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244490,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then over the next couple of months,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246260,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it merged with other small fires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247850,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create an enormous complex of megafires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250400,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that blazed across 1.4\nmillion acres of land."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1254840,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's around the size of\nthe entire state of Delaware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258170,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's 70 times bigger\nthan the previous record,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261080,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 50 times the area of all the fires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263660,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the previous 15 years combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267080,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what was so special\nabout the 1988 fires?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270470,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, to find out, we made\na forest fire simulator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273920,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We've got a grid of squares,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276380,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and on each square,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either a tree could be\nthere, it could grow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280160,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could not be there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281240,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's gonna be some probability\nfor lightning strikes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284060,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the higher that probability,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286040,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more fires we're gonna have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287780,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can run this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289490,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So trees are growing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290960,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] Trees are growing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292490,
    "dDurationMs": 1353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Forest is filling in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295550,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296450,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting pretty dense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298040,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What do you expect is gonna happen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299900,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I expect to see some fires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303290,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably, you know, now that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305480,
    "dDurationMs": 1138,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306618,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307451,
    "dDurationMs": 1906,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was a good little fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309357,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312289,
    "dDurationMs": 1414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314750,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No way!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317030,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1319220,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You haven't adjusted\nthe parameters, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320870,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just like-\n- Not yet, not yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322850,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This seems like a very critical\nsituation just by itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327500,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I say that because of\nhow big that fire was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329870,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This sort of system will\ntune itself to criticality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334160,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can see it start to happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336050,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336920,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's a good moment\nwhere you have basically domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339620,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a lot of different sizes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341600,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then one way to think about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343340,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is if some of these\ndomains become too big,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346220,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you get a single fire\nlike that one, perfectly timed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350060,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Burns them all out.\n- It's just gonna propagate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351710,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughout the whole thing and\nburn it back down a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354770,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then if it goes too hard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356270,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then now you've got all these domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357537,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where there are no trees"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358370,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it's gonna grow again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360290,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bring it back to that critical state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362360,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I can see how it's the\nfeedback mechanism, right,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365390,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the fire gets rid of all the trees"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1367790,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's nothing left to burn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369470,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then that has to fill in again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371420,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] Yeah.\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372740,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if there hasn't been a fire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374360,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the forest gets too thick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375980,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it's ripe for\nthis sort of massive fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380270,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- For a magnet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381103,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to painstakingly\ntune it to the critical point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383750,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the forest naturally\ndrives itself there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386720,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This phenomenon is called\nself-organized criticality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390080,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, and if you let it run,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391370,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you get is, again,\na power law distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395180,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is log-log,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396890,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it should be a straight line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398630,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That kind of stuff\nseems so totally random"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402050,
    "dDurationMs": 987,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and unpredictable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403037,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is in one way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405050,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet it follows a pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406640,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a consistent mathematical pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408650,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all these kind of disasters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411445,
    "dDurationMs": 1855,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's shocking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413300,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is there something fractal about this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416210,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Mostly in terms of the, I\nguess, domains of the trees"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419810,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you're at that critical state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422240,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you get very dense areas,\nyou get non-dense areas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425750,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result, when a\nsingle lightning bolt strikes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428360,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can get fires of all sizes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430610,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most often you get small fires\nof 10 or fewer trees burning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434210,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A little less frequently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435500,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get fires of less than 100 trees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437660,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then every once in a while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439430,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get these massive fires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441200,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that reverberate throughout\nthe entire system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444140,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you might expect that\nbecause the fire is so large,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446810,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there has to be a\nsignificant event causing it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449660,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's not the case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451190,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the cause for each\nfire is the exact same,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453920,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a single lightning strike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456080,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only difference is where it strikes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458360,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the exact makeup of\nthe forest at that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461180,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in some very real way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463310,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the large fires are nothing more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464930,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than magnified versions of the small ones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467300,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even worse, they're inevitable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469610,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we've learned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470630,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that for systems in a critical state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472700,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are no special events\ncausing the massive fires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475550,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was nothing special\nabout the Yellowstone fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479000,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In 1935, the US Forest\nService established"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481730,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the so-called 10:00 AM policy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484040,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The plan was to suppress every single fire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486140,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by 10:00 AM on the day\nfollowing its initial report."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489620,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, naively, this strategy makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492170,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you keep all\nfires under strict control,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494840,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then none can ever get out of hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497240,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it turns out this\nstrategy is extremely risky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501470,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So let's say we're gonna bring down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504050,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lightning probability,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505730,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's very small,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506930,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only one in a million right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508880,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're also gonna crank up\nthe tree growth a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512780,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what do you think is gonna happen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514910,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're gonna get some big\nfires, I would imagine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517460,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a lot of not fire\nand then some huge fires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521660,
    "dDurationMs": 1326,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522986,
    "dDurationMs": 2124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525110,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526100,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh boy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527240,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] So nowadays,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528073,
    "dDurationMs": 2257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fire service has a\nvery different approach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530330,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They acknowledge that\nsome fires are essential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532520,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make the megafires less likely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534830,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they let most small fires burn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536720,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and only intervene when necessary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539030,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some cases, they even\nintentionally create small fires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542180,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to burn through some of the buildup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544220,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though it could take years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545360,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to return the forest to its natural state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547190,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after a century of fire suppression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549860,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's more than just\nthe Earth's forests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551720,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are balanced in this critical state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554900,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every day, the Earth's crust is moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556970,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and rearranging itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558290,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stresses build up slowly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1559730,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as tectonic plates rub against each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562280,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the time, you get\na few rocks crumbling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564830,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ground might move just\na fraction of a millimeter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567740,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the stresses dissipate\nin many earthquakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569960,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you wouldn't even feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1571790,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There are really tiny earthquakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573260,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are happening right\nnow beneath your feet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576620,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just can't feel 'em\nbecause they're very small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579350,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they are earthquakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1580460,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're driven by small slipping movements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583610,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Earth's crust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1585020,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] But sometimes\nthose random movements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587180,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can trigger a powerful chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590540,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] In Kobe, Japan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591560,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the morning of January 17, 1995\nseemed just like any other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595340,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was a peaceful city,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596690,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and although Japan as a country"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598220,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is no stranger to earthquakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599720,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kobe hadn't suffered a\nmajor quake for centuries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602630,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Generations grew up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603650,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "believing the ground\nbeneath them was stable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1606560,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that morning, deep underground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608390,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a stress released nearby\nthe Nojima fault line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611960,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The stress propagated to the\nnext section of the fault"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614630,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615560,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within seconds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616430,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ruptured cascaded along\n40 kilometers of crust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619460,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shifting the ground by up to two meters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621530,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and releasing the energy equivalent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623120,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of numerous atomic bombs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625130,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The resulting quake\ndestroyed thousands of homes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627590,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along with most major roads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629030,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and railways leading into the city."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630830,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It killed over 6,000 people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632780,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and forced 300,000 from their homes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636380,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How far it goes depends a lot on chance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639230,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the organization of\nall that stress field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642260,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Earth's crust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643430,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it just seems to be\norganized in such a way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646340,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it is possible oftentimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648680,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the earthquake to\ntrickle along an avalanche"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651350,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along a long way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652850,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and produce a very large\nunusual earthquake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655370,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at the process\nbehind that earthquake,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657980,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is exactly the same physical process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660830,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just that the\nearthquake-generating process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663200,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "naturally produces events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665000,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that range over an\nenormous range of scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1667760,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're not really used\nto thinking about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670010,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have this ingrained assumption"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671750,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can use the past\nto predict the future,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1674390,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when it comes to earthquakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676040,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or any system that's in a critical state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678740,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that assumption can be catastrophic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680870,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they're famously unpredictable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682940,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, how can you even\nbegin to model something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685190,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the behavior of earthquakes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687440,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] In 1987,\nDanish physicist Per Bak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689960,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his colleagues considered\na simple thought experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692930,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take a grain of sand\nand drop it on a grid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695570,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then keep dropping grains on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697760,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until at some point the\nsandpile gets so steep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700550,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the grains tumble down\nonto different squares."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703790,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What they looked at\nwas the size of these,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707330,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what they were calling avalanches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708920,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these reorganizations of\nnumbers of grains of sand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712460,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They asked for how often\ndo you see avalanches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714530,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a certain size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716090,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is the most simple\nversion of a sandpile simulator"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720200,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you could almost imagine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721250,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're gonna drop a little grain of sand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723590,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at first always in the center,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725630,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it's just gonna keep going up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1727820,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For one grain, it'll be fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1729110,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For two grains, it'll be fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730250,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three grains, it'll be fine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731810,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's on the edge of toppling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733310,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when it reaches four or more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735470,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's gonna basically go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738740,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels a bit like a, I\ndon't know, pulsing thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741530,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like something's trying\nto escape or something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743630,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very video game-like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745340,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That seemed pretty crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746750,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is symmetrical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748970,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, nice geometric features."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751130,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So this might be interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752150,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because right now we passed it at a point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754340,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where this middle one is gonna go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757970,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you look around it and you see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759890,
    "dDurationMs": 4270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "essentially you can think of these brown"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765253,
    "dDurationMs": 3107,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or these three tall grain stacks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1769280,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as being maximally unstable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770660,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're about to go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771920,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so you could think of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773150,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as these fingers of instability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775880,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If anything touches them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777770,
    "dDurationMs": 2379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, they're just gonna go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780149,
    "dDurationMs": 2751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(lively music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782900,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I see it propagating out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785150,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's cool seeing it slower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786680,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like you can see several waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790430,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "propagating at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792650,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Some people have reasoned\nthat the Earth's crust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1794660,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "becomes riddled with similar\nfingers of instability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797540,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you get stresses building up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1799370,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then when one rock crumbles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801140,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can propagate along these fingers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803060,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potentially triggering\nmassive earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806060,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at the data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807230,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's some even more compelling evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809360,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that links the sandpile\nsimulation to earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813290,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's say instead of\ndropping it at the center,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815450,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty unrealistic to have\nit drop in the center,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1818300,
    "dDurationMs": 1703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna drop at random."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823441,
    "dDurationMs": 1579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hah!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1825020,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826430,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You can actually see it tune itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828230,
    "dDurationMs": 1113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the critical state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830900,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like at the start,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831800,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you only see these super tiny avalanches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835250,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then now it's everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836450,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It has to build up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838190,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We can slow down a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842247,
    "dDurationMs": 2036,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, and that's a super clean power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845450,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are events of all sizes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847520,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One grain of sand might\nknock over just a few others"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850220,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could trigger an\navalanche of millions of grains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1853490,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that cascade throughout the entire system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856340,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you look at the power law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858260,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get from the sandpile simulation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860090,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it closely resembles the power law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862310,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the energy released\nby real earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865880,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at the sandpile\nexperiment more closely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1868310,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't just resemble earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1870920,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does it remind you of?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872420,
    "dDurationMs": 2095,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Forest fires.\n- [Casper] Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874515,
    "dDurationMs": 2405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like it's the\nexact same behavior."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876920,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's the really surprising thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878720,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why this little\npaper with a sandpile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880850,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was published in the world's top journal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883280,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it did something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884300,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that people just didn't\nreally think was possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887660,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, what's ironic is if\nyou look at real sandpiles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891230,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't behave like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893870,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, you said sand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1895070,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna do an experiment\non a real sandpile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897380,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, it doesn't\nfollow a power law distribution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899870,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of avalanches at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901640,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's totally wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1903293,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Steven and Derek laugh)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904670,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Per Bak, naturally, gets a\nchance to reply to the criticism,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909140,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he says, I'm pretty close to quoting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he says, \"Self-organized criticality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914420,
    "dDurationMs": 3013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only applies to the\nsystems it applies to.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1917433,
    "dDurationMs": 1337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Steven laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918770,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he doesn't care,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920090,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fact that his theory is\nnot relevant to real sandpiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923480,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924410,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get out of my face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925610,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's interested in bigger\nfish to fry than sandpiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930350,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, you're taking me too literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932300,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm talking about a universal mechanism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1934250,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for generating power laws."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935990,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fact that it\ndoesn't work in real sand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938960,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is uninteresting to him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1940520,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought that took some real nerve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942800,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You could think about the Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946280,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the Earth going around the Sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948260,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a very complex system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951258,
    "dDurationMs": 902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got the molten core,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952160,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything sloshing around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1953240,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you've got oceans,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954560,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you've even got the\nmoon going around the Earth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956510,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which in theory, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958100,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all should affect the exact motion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960020,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the Earth around the Sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1962210,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Newton ignored all of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1964100,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all he looked at was just a\nsingle parameter, essentially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1968450,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mass of the Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970100,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that, he could\ncorrectly, for the most part,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972290,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "predict how the Earth was\ngonna go around the Sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1974510,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1976130,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are people that have\nlooked at these phenomena"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978440,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that go to the critical state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1980000,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this case it's\nself-organized criticality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983120,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is it brings itself there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1985070,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what they find is that\nthere's this universal behavior"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987890,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it doesn't even really\nmatter what the subparts are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991370,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just get the behavior\nthat's the exact same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994760,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- At that critical point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996410,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when all the forces are poised"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998750,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the system is right\non that delicate balance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2001240,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between being organized, highly organized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004360,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or being totally disorganized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2006160,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it turns out that almost\nnone of the physical details"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009820,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about that system matter\nto how it behaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013810,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just a universal\nbehavior that is irrespective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017290,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what physical system\nyou're talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019840,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The term that was used\nis called universality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022810,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's kind of a miracle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2024100,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it means you can make\nextremely powerful theories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2027340,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without involving any technical details,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029470,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any real details of the material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032080,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What this means is that\nyou could have these systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2034150,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that on the surface\nseem totally different,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2037240,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you get to the critical point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038890,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they all behave in the exact same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041590,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing you could do\nis instead of this being trees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2045400,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could imagine it being people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047230,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the thing that's spreading-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2048880,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is disease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049900,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is disease, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2052390,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You almost get something for nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2055030,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at these critical points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2056560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- See, many of these systems\nfall into what's known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2058840,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as universality classes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2060490,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of them you need\nto tune to get there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like magnets at their Curie temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2064420,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or fluids like water or carbon dioxide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2067180,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at their critical point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068440,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but some other systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2069790,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seem to organize\nthemselves to criticality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2072220,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the forest fires or\nsandpiles or earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076000,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what's crazy is that if you succeed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078280,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in understanding just\none system from a class,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081100,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you know how all the\nsystems in that class behave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084670,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that includes even the\ncrudest simplest toy models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088210,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the simulations we've looked at."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2090220,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can model\nincredibly complex systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093310,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the most basic of models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2095320,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And some people think\nthis critical thinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097540,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "applies even further."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099160,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we look around the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100570,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are lots of systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2101950,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that show the same power law behavior"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103750,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we see in this critical systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105760,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's in everything from DNA sequencing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2108040,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the distribution of\nspecies in an ecosystem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110950,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the size of mass\nextinctions throughout history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2113920,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We even see the same\nbehavior in human systems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116560,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the populations of cities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118270,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fluctuations in stock prices,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120220,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "citations of scientific papers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2122260,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even the number of deaths in wars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2125340,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So some people argue that these systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127900,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and perhaps many parts of our\nworld also organize themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131440,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this critical point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2133000,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So the fact that all\nthese natural hazards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2135370,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as they call them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2136203,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "floods, wildfires, and earthquakes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138220,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they all follow power law distributions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2140440,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means that these extreme\nevents are much more common"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2145060,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than you would think based on\nnormal distribution thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2148180,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you find yourself in a situation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2150160,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or an environment that is sort\nof governed by a power law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154270,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how should you change your behavior?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156670,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you have events with one\nof these power distributions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2161050,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you're seeing most of\nthe time is small events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164350,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this can lull you into\na false sense of security,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2168250,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you think you understand\nhow things are going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2170260,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, floods for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2171880,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a lot of small floods,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172870,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then every once in a\nwhile, there's a huge one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175120,
    "dDurationMs": 2283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One response to this is insurance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178420,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that insurance is designed precisely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181510,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to protect you against\nthe large rare events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184300,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would otherwise be very bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2185770,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then there's the other\nside of that picture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189310,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is you are the insurance company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191620,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that needs to insure people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193540,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have a particularly difficult job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195520,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they have to be able\nto say how much to charge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2199750,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that they have enough money to pay out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201580,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the big bad thing comes along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204070,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] In 2018,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204903,
    "dDurationMs": 2557,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a forest fire tore through\nParadise, California,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207460,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it became the deadliest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208570,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and most destructive fire\nin the state's history,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211330,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the insurance company,\nMerced Property \u0026 Casualty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2214360,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hadn't planned for something that huge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2217240,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when the claims came in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218770,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they just didn't have\nthe reserves to pay out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2221650,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just like that, the company went bust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2224920,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But while extreme events\ncan cripple some companies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2227890,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are entire industries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2229870,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are built on power law distributions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2232600,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between 1985 and 2014,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2235630,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "private equity firm Horsley Bridge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2237580,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "invested in 7,000 different startups"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240220,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and over half of their\ninvestments actually lost money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2243070,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the top 6% more than 10xed in value"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2246400,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and generated 60% of the\nfirm's overall profit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2249790,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the best venture capital firms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2251740,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often have more investments\nthat lose money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2254200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they just have a few crazy outliers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2256540,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that show extraordinary growth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2258430,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a few outliers that carry\nthe entire performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2261640,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2012, Y Combinator calculated\nthat 75% of their returns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2266380,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came from just two out of the\n280 startups they invested in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270460,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So venture capital is a world\nthat depends on taking risks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2273880,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the hope that you'll get a\nfew of these extreme outliers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2277150,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which outperform all of the rest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2278890,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the investments combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2280900,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Book publishers\noperate in a similar fashion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2283540,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most titles flop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2285040,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in 1997,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2286390,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a small independent UK\npublisher called Bloomsbury"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2289270,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "took a chance on a story\nabout a boy wizard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2292030,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The boy's name, of\ncourse, was Harry Potter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2294340,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now Bloomsbury is a\nglobally recognized brand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2298300,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We see a similar pattern play\nout on streaming platforms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2301210,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On Netflix, the top 6% of\nshows account for over half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2304810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all viewing hours on the platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2306790,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307660,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less than 4% of videos\never reach 10,000 views,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2310870,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but those videos account\nfor over 93% of all views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2315220,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All these domains\nfollow the same principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2317200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Pareto identified over 100 years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319930,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the majority of the\nwealth goes to the richest few."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323410,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The entire game is defined\nby the rare runaway hits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2327310,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But not every industry\ncan play this game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2330430,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like if you're running a restaurant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2331750,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to fill tables night after night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334000,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't have one particularly\nbusy summer evening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2336250,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that brings in millions of customers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2337870,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make up for a bunch of quiet nights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340000,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over a year, the busy nights\nand quiet ones balance out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342820,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're left with the average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2344650,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Airlines are similar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2345820,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an airline needs to fill\nseats on each flight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348280,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't squeeze a million\npassengers onto one plane,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2351220,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's the average number\nof passengers over the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2353620,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that defines an airline's success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2356170,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're used to living in this world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2357490,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of normal distributions\nand you act a certain way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360310,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as soon as you switch to this realm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362770,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is governed by a power law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364090,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to start acting vastly different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366610,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really pays to know what kind of world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2368980,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or what kind of game you're playing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2370720,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That is good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371553,
    "dDurationMs": 1207,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's good, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2372760,
    "dDurationMs": 3053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should come on camera and\njust say that just like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375813,
    "dDurationMs": 2092,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were on camera, you just did do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2377905,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Steven laughs)\n- If you are in a world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380064,
    "dDurationMs": 2896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where random additive\nvariations cancel out over time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382960,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you get a normal distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384910,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in this case, it's\nthe average performance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2387370,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so consistency, which is important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2390010,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you are in a world\nthat's governed by a power law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392860,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where your returns can multiply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394540,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can grow over\nmany orders of magnitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2397240,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it might make sense\nto take some riskier bets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2399820,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the hope that one\nof them pays off huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2402220,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2403053,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it becomes more important to\nbe persistent than consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2407020,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Though as we saw\nin the second coin game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2408820,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "totally random multiplicative returns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410800,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "give you a log normal\ndistribution, not a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2414280,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To get a power law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2415150,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there must be some\nother mechanism at play."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2418810,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the early 2000s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2419950,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Albert-László Barabási\nwas studying the internet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2422650,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to his surprise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2423610,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he found that there was no normal webpage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426130,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with some average number of links."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428170,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, the distribution\nfollowed a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2430720,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few sites like Yahoo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2432190,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had thousands of times more connections"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2434410,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than most of the others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2436030,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Barabasi wondered what could be causing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2438250,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this power law of the internet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2439900,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he made a simple prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2441610,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As new sites were added to the internet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2443860,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were more likely to\nlink to well-known pages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2446890,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To test this prediction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2448060,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he and his colleague Réka Albert \nran a simulation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2451570,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They started with a\nnetwork of just a few nodes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2453910,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gradually they added\nnew nodes to the network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2456550,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with each new node more\nlikely to connect to those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2459130,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the most links."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2460450,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the network grew, a power law emerged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2463420,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The power was around negative two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2465190,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which almost exactly matched\nthe real data of the internet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2468910,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] Look at that.\n- [Derek] That's fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2471040,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's still so satisfying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2472420,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This will basically also\ndistribute a power law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2475510,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the ideas here is that\nthis could be individuals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2478510,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even companies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2479560,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so if you're more likely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2481150,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to become more successful\nor more well known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2485260,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or successful you already are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2486910,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're gonna get this\nsort of runaway effect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2488620,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you get a few that sort\nof dominate the distributions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2493390,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder if part of the takeaway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2494920,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is like if you're\nplaying some sort of game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2497350,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is dominated by a power law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2499300,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you better do the work as much of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501550,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as early as possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2502720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you get to benefit from the\nsnowball effect, essentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2506320,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I guess that's a good idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2508660,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure whether you\ncan control it, though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2510880,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Human beings like to think of ourselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2512680,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as being a bit special,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2514390,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that maybe somehow\nbecause we're intelligent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2516820,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and have free will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2519730,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We will escape the provenance\nof the laws of physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2525010,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order and organization,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2526930,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think that's probably not the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2529120,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you look at the\nnumber of world wars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2532450,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you make a crude measure\nof how big is the world war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2535870,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by how many people it kills,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2538600,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a bit macabre, but still,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2541060,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that, again,\nit follows a power law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2543640,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "virtually identical to\nthe power law you find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545710,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in stock market crashes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2547630,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So if the world is shaped by power laws,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2550420,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it feels like we're poised"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2552070,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this kind of critical state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2553840,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where two identical grains of sand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2556060,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two identical actions can\nhave wildly different effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2560020,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most things barely move the needle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2562030,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a few rare events\ntotally dwarf the rest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2564850,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that, I think, is the\nmost important lesson."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2567760,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you choose to pursue areas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2569530,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "governed by the normal distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2571300,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can pretty much\nguarantee average results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2574150,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you select pursuits\nruled by power laws,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576670,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the goal isn't to avoid risk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2578410,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's to make repeated intelligent bets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2580900,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of them will fail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2582280,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you only need one wild\nsuccess to pay for all the rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2586090,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And the thing is that\nbeforehand you cannot know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2588880,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which bet is going to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2590080,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the system is\nmaximally unpredictable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2592630,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be that your\nnext bet does nothing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2594520,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it could do a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2595660,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could change your entire life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598090,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, around three years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2599860,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was reading this little book,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2601570,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in the book there was this little line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2603370,
    "dDurationMs": 1057,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying something like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2604427,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"One idea could transform\nyour entire life.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2607960,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So right underneath that, I wrote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609977,
    "dDurationMs": 2153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Send an email to Veritasium.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612130,
    "dDurationMs": 2287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A couple days later, I wrote\nan email to Derek, saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2614417,
    "dDurationMs": 2093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Hey, Derek, I'm Casper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2616510,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I study physics and I can\nhelp you research videos.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2619330,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't hear back for four weeks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2621130,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I was getting pretty sad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2622600,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and just wanted to forget\nabout it and move on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2626290,
    "dDurationMs": 3007,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then a couple days later\nI got an email back saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2629297,
    "dDurationMs": 3113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Hey, Casper, we can't do\nan internship right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2632410,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but how would you like to research, write,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2634810,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and produce a video as a freelancer?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2637180,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I did,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2638200,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's how I get\nstarted at Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2644290,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, just a few quick final things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2646720,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the simulations that\nwe used in this video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2649090,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll make available\nfor free for you to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2651730,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the link in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2654100,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the other thing is\nthat we just launched"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2656440,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the official Veritasium game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2658420,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called Elements of Truth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2659740,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's a tabletop game\nwith over 800 questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2662830,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the perfect way to\nchallenge your friends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2665950,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see who comes out on top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2667300,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, at Veritasium, we're\nall quite competitive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2670180,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so every time we play, things\nget a little bit heated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2672940,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's honestly a big part of the fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675880,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when we launched on Kickstarter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2677710,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we got a lot of questions asking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2679690,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we could ship to specific countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2682150,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And originally we didn't enable this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2684550,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is our mistake,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2685960,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is on us and we totally hear you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2688450,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm glad to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2689410,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that right now we have\nenabled worldwide shipping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2692320,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So no matter where you are in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2694000,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can get your very own copy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2695950,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To reserve your copy and get involved,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2698680,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scan this QR code or click\nthe link in the description."
